WEBVTT

00:00:04.269 --> 00:00:06.269
Latifa: (unintelligible)

00:00:06.713 --> 00:00:16.265
[2:188]  You shall not take each others' money dishonestly, nor shall you bribe the officials in order to take other people's money, sinfully and knowingly.

00:00:18.042 --> 00:00:20.264
Latifa: (unintelligible)

00:00:20.264 --> 00:00:24.579
Dr. Khalifa: Whatever, it's up to you. If you want to stop and take it verse by verse.

00:00:24.579 --> 00:00:26.312
Latifa: (unintelligible)

00:00:27.066 --> 00:00:31.778
Latifa: To me, that's my understanding (unintelligible) we should not take each other's money.

00:00:31.778 --> 00:00:33.778
Well, (unintelligible)

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.666
Again, some, sometimes people like to bribe other people for things that they want,

00:00:40.666 --> 00:00:45.267
and they, then, they're doing these type of things in the man's eyesight,

00:00:45.267 --> 00:00:49.000
and not really being aware that Allah is seeing it all.

00:00:49.711 --> 00:00:55.000
And while they're stealing from the people, Allah is seeing (unintelligible)

00:00:56.311 --> 00:00:57.935
So, Allah, says, do

00:00:57.935 --> 00:01:01.046
[2:188]  ... not take each others' money dishonestly, ...

00:01:01.046 --> 00:01:04.113
Latifa: or (unintelligible) bribe all that's (unintelligible)

00:01:04.972 --> 00:01:12.344
Dr. Khalifa: Okay, just, just put this in perspective. You said that God, God schemes.

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:16.276
Latifa: Okay, what I said...
Dr. Khalifa: Yeah, you said, you said God will scheme against you, right?

00:01:17.202 --> 00:01:21.899
Latifa: I'm saying like, okay, like me and you, and I,

00:01:21.899 --> 00:01:24.344
say prayers to (unintelligible)

00:01:24.344 --> 00:01:27.303
for five dollars, something like that.

00:01:27.303 --> 00:01:32.666
And then, I may take these five dollars and go get me a pint of gin or something, or,

00:01:32.666 --> 00:01:35.252
or go pay those lotteries or something like this.

00:01:35.252 --> 00:01:39.464
But then, I might have told you that I needed something to eat, or something like that.

00:01:39.464 --> 00:01:41.606
And so, to me, that's being dishonest.

00:01:41.606 --> 00:01:48.170
And then also, if I understand what this verse is like,

00:01:48.170 --> 00:01:53.505
if I will say things that something happened to me and I went to jail,

00:01:53.505 --> 00:01:54.505
and

00:01:54.505 --> 00:01:57.000
I needed to get out,

00:01:57.000 --> 00:02:00.303
and I will pay the, the officials,

00:02:00.303 --> 00:02:04.000
you know, like they think that I stole something from somebody or hurt somebody,

00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:07.798
and then, I would pay the officials to get out of jail or bribe them,

00:02:07.798 --> 00:02:13.000
"let me get, I'll give you fifty dollars or a hundred dollars if you let me out. Don't worry about those other people."

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:15.000
And then, they take it.

00:02:15.303 --> 00:02:19.303
And so, I'm, I'm worried about these other people not hearing

00:02:19.303 --> 00:02:23.000
and seeing me make this bribe with the judge or whomever,

00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:26.000
whereas God is looking directly at both of us.

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:28.546
Or we're both going to be in trouble.

00:02:28.546 --> 00:02:33.556
But most men, you know, people curious don't think like that.

00:02:33.556 --> 00:02:36.202
They think that they're trying to hide it from men alone,

00:02:36.202 --> 00:02:39.000
whereas God is looking at the thing on the (unintelligible)

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:42.000
because of they think they're (unintelligible) a lot of trouble.

00:02:42.000 --> 00:02:44.000
Latifa: But that's my understanding.

00:02:44.711 --> 00:02:48.711
Dr. Khalifa: Also, to put this in a, in terms that happened to,

00:02:48.711 --> 00:02:51.000
what we're saying is that when you (unintelligible) God schemes,

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:53.311
you're, you're very correct,

00:02:53.311 --> 00:02:58.244
in that you go to the market and you buy things and then,

00:02:58.244 --> 00:03:02.355
you go and give the, that they,

00:03:02.355 --> 00:03:04.001
Dr. Khalifa: what do you call the...

00:03:04.001 --> 00:03:05.023
A woman: cashier.

00:03:05.023 --> 00:03:06.000
Dr. Khalifa: cashier?

00:03:06.400 --> 00:03:08.311
You give the cashier five dollars

00:03:08.311 --> 00:03:11.400
and she thinks that you gave her twenty dollars.

00:03:12.466 --> 00:03:13.823
Well, she gives you the change.

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:18.733
You bought things for two dollars and she gives you eighteen dollars back.

00:03:18.733 --> 00:03:21.311
Because she thought you gave her twenty dollars,

00:03:21.311 --> 00:03:23.400
when you really gave her five dollars.

00:03:23.933 --> 00:03:28.198
Now, you have two choices. You can take the eighteen dollars and walk out,

00:03:28.198 --> 00:03:31.222
in which case you are eating other people's money dishonestly,

00:03:31.222 --> 00:03:33.666
because at the end of the day, she will count her money and

00:03:33.666 --> 00:03:36.000
she will be short fifteen dollars.

00:03:36.977 --> 00:03:39.488
Or you can give her the money back,

00:03:39.488 --> 00:03:40.689
like the Quran tells you.

00:03:40.689 --> 00:03:43.000
The Quran says, you give her the money back,

00:03:43.000 --> 00:03:45.000
because I gave her only five dollars.

00:03:48.022 --> 00:03:52.266
Now, when you said God schemes, it's because if you do walk out with the money,

00:03:52.266 --> 00:03:54.579
you eat other people's money dishonestly.

00:03:55.600 --> 00:04:00.266
That person, you, you don't make fifteen dollars.

00:04:00.266 --> 00:04:04.000
You actually lose a lot more than the fifteen dollars.

00:04:04.311 --> 00:04:09.156
Dr. Khalifa: Something else will happen where you lose a lot of money.

00:04:09.822 --> 00:04:13.355
Latifa: And you may go home and, and on your way home, you get a ticket.

00:04:13.355 --> 00:04:16.000
Dr. Khalifa: Right. For, for seventy dollars.
Latifa: (unintelligible)

00:04:16.000 --> 00:04:17.223
Dr. Khalifa: Speeding ticket.

00:04:19.311 --> 00:04:22.444
Or worse yet, you get in an accident or something.

00:04:24.088 --> 00:04:25.956
Because breaking God's law is very serious.

00:04:25.956 --> 00:04:29.267
You know, the seriousness here is not just taking fifteen dollars.

00:04:29.267 --> 00:04:31.000
You know, fifteen dollars is nothing.

00:04:31.000 --> 00:04:34.245
But the serious matter is really disobeying God.

00:04:35.267 --> 00:04:37.267
When, when He says, it's a commandment,

00:04:37.267 --> 00:04:41.334
[2:188]  You shall not take each others' money dishonestly, ...

00:04:42.577 --> 00:04:49.643
Dr. Khalifa: So, in that case, you return the money because God says you return the money, regardless of how much it is.

00:04:49.865 --> 00:04:51.199
A woman: (unintelligible)

00:04:52.444 --> 00:04:53.077
Dr. Khalifa: Yeah.

00:04:54.632 --> 00:05:04.939
A woman: Isn't (unintelligible)

00:05:04.939 --> 00:05:10.000
A woman: but (unintelligible)

00:05:10.000 --> 00:05:13.311
Dr. Khalifa: Right, because it will cost you a lot more,
A woman: When I...

00:05:13.311 --> 00:05:17.000
Dr. Khalifa: It will cost you a lot more than, than the price of the cigarettes.

00:05:17.000 --> 00:05:20.423
A woman: But they, sometimes they charge more than they cost.

00:05:21.178 --> 00:05:27.887
Dr. Khalifa: You'd rather better, it's better that you lose money than you gain money, because God never says (unintelligible)

00:05:29.175 --> 00:05:34.507
A woman: (unintelligible) but it wasn't, it wasn't my intention that (unintelligible)

00:05:34.507 --> 00:05:41.688
Dr. Khalifa: Yeah, you better, you make sure that you are a victim rather than the aggressor, because God makes it up to you.

00:05:45.000 --> 00:05:50.933
So, the Muslim is aware that when this happens, the people usually look at you like, like, (unintelligible)

00:05:50.933 --> 00:05:53.000
you know, there are some honest people around here.

00:05:53.000 --> 00:05:56.000
They don't realize that you'll return it because you're scared to death.

00:05:58.000 --> 00:05:59.778
Because it will actually cost you a lot more,

00:05:59.778 --> 00:06:03.245
because it is a lot smarter to give back the money.

00:06:04.489 --> 00:06:06.334
It's a lot smarter, a lot cheaper.

00:06:06.834 --> 00:06:09.500
And you make a lot more money than what you were gonna make.

00:06:09.500 --> 00:06:10.000
Dr. Khalifa: Yes.

00:06:10.000 --> 00:06:15.000
A woman: Like we had a movie about someone who finds a hundred thousands of dollars,

00:06:15.000 --> 00:06:17.666
A woman: (unintelligible)

00:06:17.666 --> 00:06:18.444
Dr. Khalifa: Right.

00:06:20.798 --> 00:06:25.289
Dr. Khalifa: Because they belong to somebody who worked very hard for them, or whatever.

00:06:25.821 --> 00:06:27.645
Dean Mahmoud: I know someone who never returned it.

00:06:29.022 --> 00:06:29.689
Dr. Khalifa: Oh, yeah.

00:06:33.287 --> 00:06:35.511
A man: Some people have a real struggle, man.

00:06:37.421 --> 00:06:39.977
Dean Mahmoud: (unintelligible)

00:06:39.977 --> 00:06:41.089
Dr. Khalifa: This is a real test.

00:06:41.311 --> 00:06:42.289
Dean Mahmoud: I...

00:06:42.822 --> 00:06:45.000
Dr. Khalifa: Okay, Latifa. Back to you.

00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:46.011
Dean Mahmoud: No, no.

00:06:47.200 --> 00:06:52.556
Latifa: Ok, As far as, as far as the bribery, is that the type of bribery (unintelligible)

00:06:52.556 --> 00:06:53.056
A woman: Yep.

00:06:53.933 --> 00:06:59.200
Dr. Khalifa: Well, bribery was, we had a, a national case of bribery on the TV and the radio.
Dean Mahmoud: Yeah.

00:06:59.511 --> 00:07:00.223
Dean Mahmoud: The senator

00:07:00.223 --> 00:07:08.000
Dr. Khalifa: The head of the Teamsters Union was found guilty of trying to bribe a senator,

00:07:08.000 --> 00:07:12.000
give him a few acres of land in Las Vegas.

00:07:12.000 --> 00:07:17.000
Because, because they wanted the senator to oppose

00:07:17.000 --> 00:07:19.977
deregulation of a trucking industry, which means

00:07:19.977 --> 00:07:23.000
 the drivers make a lot of money from you and me.

00:07:24.377 --> 00:07:27.000
So that, this is why, when you read it, it says,

00:07:27.000 --> 00:07:33.000
[2:188]  ... nor shall you bribe the officials in order to take other people's money, sinfully and knowingly.

00:07:34.022 --> 00:07:40.045
So, what the Teamsters Union president wanted was to take the people's money sinfully and knowingly.

00:07:40.445 --> 00:07:48.977
Because the deregulation of a trucking industry, make, made the trucking business cheaper for us, and less money for them.

00:07:50.155 --> 00:07:51.067
Dr. Khalifa: That's a bribe.

00:07:53.245 --> 00:07:54.490
A man: (unintelligible)

00:07:55.556 --> 00:08:00.000
A man: Suppose it probably been in a society where

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:02.000
A man: the bribe was become

00:08:02.000 --> 00:08:03.645
Dr. Khalifa: a way of life.
A man: (unintelligible)

00:08:03.956 --> 00:08:04.757
A man: (unintelligible)

00:08:04.757 --> 00:08:05.424
A man: Yeah.

00:08:05.424 --> 00:08:06.091
Dr. Khalifa: (unintelligible)

00:08:06.091 --> 00:08:10.490
A man: If, if, if we don't bribe, you cannot get any where in your own life.

00:08:10.845 --> 00:08:11.379
Dr. Khalifa: Yes.

00:08:11.956 --> 00:08:14.822
A man: Is it Haram (Prohibited) to bribe in that, in that case?
Dr. Khalifa: Yes.

00:08:14.822 --> 00:08:15.322
Dr. Khalifa: Yes.

00:08:15.322 --> 00:08:16.507
A man: Even though you couldn't... 

00:08:17.012 --> 00:08:17.851
Dr. Khalifa: Yes.

00:08:17.851 --> 00:08:19.043
A man: (unintelligible) bribe

00:08:19.043 --> 00:08:21.867
Dr. Khalifa: You shall not bribe. That's a commandment.

00:08:23.331 --> 00:08:31.539
Dr. Khalifa: What, what a bribe does, you want a visa, for example, to leave the country and you can get it if you bribe, if you bribe.

00:08:32.296 --> 00:08:36.366
Dean Mahmoud: But suppose staying in the country means they will kill you unjustly.

00:08:37.022 --> 00:08:39.022
Dr. Khalifa: Now, Dean Mahmoud makes it very difficult.

00:08:41.546 --> 00:08:44.656
Dean Mahmoud: Yes. Suppose you did not commit a crime,

00:08:44.656 --> 00:08:48.849
Dean Mahmoud: and your enemies in the government are going to frame you, and you know it,

00:08:48.849 --> 00:08:49.505
Dr. Khalifa: Yes.

00:08:49.505 --> 00:08:54.445
Dean Mahmoud: and you're given a chance to leave the country, but you have to give, let's say, 100 good Egyptian pounds.

00:08:55.505 --> 00:09:03.142
If you do not give the 100 good Egyptian pounds, then you will allow other people to commit also injustice.

00:09:04.000 --> 00:09:09.394
Dean Mahmoud: And then, if you die, who will feed your family, your children, and so on? I think it's a hard question.

00:09:10.454 --> 00:09:17.646
Dr. Khalifa: I, I, I make a policy of not putting myself in a test when I don't need to. So, since it's a theoretical situation.

00:09:18.101 --> 00:09:27.647
A man: But does bribery include when you are asked for payment for, for, say, a, a policeman to forget that you've done something wrong?

00:09:28.858 --> 00:09:32.719
A man: Like in the Philippines, you know, the, the cops, you see, know, you know,

00:09:32.719 --> 00:09:35.476
A man: for something, so I'm going to forget.
Dr. Khalifa: Yeah.

00:09:35.476 --> 00:09:36.454
Dr. Khalifa: Yes.

00:09:36.454 --> 00:09:38.495
A man: There's also (unintelligible)
Dean Mahmoud: Especially on Christmas.

00:09:38.495 --> 00:09:39.142
A man: Yeah.

00:09:39.647 --> 00:09:44.647
Dean Mahmoud: Yes. On Christmas, the policeman tells you, you deserve this ticket.
A man: For the Christmas gift, I'm gonna forget.

00:09:45.000 --> 00:09:47.000
Dean Mahmoud: Well, I said, I will pay for the ticket.

00:09:47.000 --> 00:09:50.252
But you know, I said, never mind, the government is rich, but my family needs it.

00:09:50.252 --> 00:09:51.669
Dean Mahmoud: So you (unintelligible)

00:09:54.830 --> 00:09:55.921
A man: Cause I was planning on...

00:09:55.921 --> 00:09:57.031
Dean Mahmoud: (unintelligible)

00:09:57.031 --> 00:09:59.353
A man: Institutionalized, right.

00:09:59.353 --> 00:10:02.609
Dr. Khalifa: Yes.
A man: Like it's just almost a standard thing, where it's

00:10:02.609 --> 00:10:05.265
A man: like going across the border or something and just...

00:10:07.303 --> 00:10:10.514
Dr. Khalifa: Nobody, nobody's gonna get me to say, go ahead and bribe.

00:10:10.514 --> 00:10:11.151
A man: Yeah.

00:10:12.715 --> 00:10:13.596
A man: Just wrong.

00:10:13.596 --> 00:10:15.442
Dr. Khalifa: The commandment is, you shall not bribe.

00:10:17.889 --> 00:10:21.468
A woman: So, God made it, maybe a little easier because He says, you shall not bribe,

00:10:21.468 --> 00:10:23.557
[2:188]  ... in order to take other people's money, sinfully ...

00:10:23.557 --> 00:10:24.057
Dr. Khalifa: Right.

00:10:24.245 --> 00:10:27.245
A woman: So, perhaps, the situation (unintelligible)

00:10:27.245 --> 00:10:30.890
A woman: Don't ask about the things that you don't, that if you knew, would hurt you.

00:10:30.890 --> 00:10:31.390
Dr. Khalifa: Yeah.

00:10:31.390 --> 00:10:37.234
But you see, the policeman, the policeman (unintelligible) will take a bribe in order to forget about the ticket.

00:10:37.423 --> 00:10:39.423
Dr. Khalifa: Now, where does the ticket money go?

00:10:39.423 --> 00:10:40.067
Dean Mahmoud: To the government.

00:10:40.067 --> 00:10:41.067
Dr. Khalifa: Your ticket, right.

00:10:41.067 --> 00:10:49.178
Your ticket goes to the general treasury, where some other people are gonna get the money, possibly salaries or whatever.

00:10:49.178 --> 00:10:53.000
Dr. Khalifa: So, what you're doing, you're diverting the money from other sources.

00:10:53.000 --> 00:10:56.000
A woman: But for the (unintelligible)
Dean Mahmoud: But that is different from the other case.

00:10:56.000 --> 00:10:59.467
Dean Mahmoud: So, suppose you want to expedite your paper, that's something else.

00:10:59.733 --> 00:11:02.000
You go again, I take Egypt again.

00:11:02.000 --> 00:11:03.200
Dean Mahmoud: I don't want Egypt.

00:11:03.422 --> 00:11:06.576
Dr. Khalifa: Ok. But you're not supposed to (unintelligible)
Dean Mahmoud: So, you are not giving money to,

00:11:06.576 --> 00:11:09.000
Dean Mahmoud: you are not going to take away money from the government.

00:11:09.000 --> 00:11:13.666
Dean Mahmoud: Government says, you must pay ten pounds for passport. All right.

00:11:13.666 --> 00:11:14.166
Dr. Khalifa: Right.

00:11:14.166 --> 00:11:19.566
Dean Mahmoud: Then, you see this hardworking man, and you tell him, "here is two pounds. Hurry up!"

00:11:20.222 --> 00:11:21.645
Dr. Khalifa: Right. You know how he will hurry up?

00:11:21.645 --> 00:11:23.178
Dean Mahmoud: Is that a bribe or is it a gift?

00:11:23.178 --> 00:11:25.000
Dr. Khalifa: Okay, I'm gonna tell you how he will hurry up.

00:11:25.622 --> 00:11:28.867
He's gonna put my papers on the side and take your paper and push it through.

00:11:29.222 --> 00:11:31.023
So, my paper is gonna be delayed.

00:11:32.222 --> 00:11:33.222
That's what happens.

00:11:33.577 --> 00:11:35.355
He will give priority to your papers

00:11:35.355 --> 00:11:39.355
Dr. Khalifa: by pushing my paper on the side or other people's papers on the side.

00:11:39.355 --> 00:11:41.400
Dean Mahmoud: No, that's true.

00:11:41.400 --> 00:11:43.755
Dr. Khalifa: Yeah, this will (unintelligible)
Dean Mahmoud: It will be at the expense of others.

00:11:43.755 --> 00:11:47.222
Dean Mahmoud: But suppose he says, he will just wake up early and work, work extra.

00:11:48.288 --> 00:11:49.955
Dr. Khalifa: No, and he will not do that.

00:11:53.065 --> 00:11:59.755
He will just, he will push the other, the other people's papers on the side and he will put your paper on the top.

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:01.245
That's what they will do.

00:12:01.600 --> 00:12:04.710
We must remember that there is a law of the Quran that says,

00:12:04.710 --> 00:12:10.711
if you are forced by circumstance without being malicious or deliberate,

00:12:10.711 --> 00:12:12.000
then you are not committing a sin.

00:12:12.977 --> 00:12:16.977
So, God understands the circumstances but if you don't get a visa, they will kill you.

00:12:16.977 --> 00:12:18.622
Now, that's self-defense.

00:12:18.622 --> 00:12:21.000
You bribe, you do anything, you are forced.

00:12:21.977 --> 00:12:25.977
You are forced by circumstance and you are not being malicious or deliberate,

00:12:25.977 --> 00:12:29.178
and certainly you are not eating other people's money dishonestly.

00:12:29.800 --> 00:12:33.089
So, God understands. It's a matter of, of common sense.

00:12:33.089 --> 00:12:35.001
Dr. Khalifa: Islam is absolutely common sense.

00:12:35.889 --> 00:12:37.000
A man: Alhamdu Lillah.

00:12:37.000 --> 00:12:38.534
Dr. Khalifa: Do you have a question, Loretta?

00:12:38.801 --> 00:12:40.801
Loretta: (unintelligible)

00:12:41.334 --> 00:12:51.597
Loretta: It's so important (unintelligible)

00:12:51.597 --> 00:12:52.097
Dr. Khalifa: Exactly.

00:12:52.097 --> 00:12:55.030
Loretta: (unintelligible)

00:12:55.030 --> 00:12:56.053
Dr. Khalifa: And there's no (unintelligible)

00:12:59.355 --> 00:13:00.578
Dr. Khalifa: Okay, back to Latifa.

00:13:06.598 --> 00:13:08.378
Do Not Beat Around the Bush

00:13:08.911 --> 00:13:25.000
[2:189]  They ask you about the phases of the moon! Say, "They provide a timing device for the people, and determine the time of Hajj pilgrimage." It is not righteous to beat around the bush by asking such irrelevant questions;* ...

00:13:25.000 --> 00:13:33.443
[2:189]  ... But the righteous thing is to be straightforward and to observe God, that you may succeed.

00:13:35.131 --> 00:13:39.265
(unintelligible) but then,

00:13:39.265 --> 00:13:44.473
I, I think that seems to have a, a pretty high (unintelligible) that in itself.

00:13:45.221 --> 00:13:47.000
But straightforward.

00:13:49.932 --> 00:13:55.022
Okay, like, like (unintelligible) they're saying that, you know, like somebody asked you about the moon.

00:13:55.022 --> 00:14:00.355
But then, Allah says, (unintelligible) they provided a timing device for the people.

00:14:00.355 --> 00:14:04.000
Latifa: But that was, you know, that's (unintelligible)

00:14:04.000 --> 00:14:10.000
Dr. Khalifa: Yeah, well, this really, this, this, they ask you, Muhammad, about the phases of the moon.

00:14:10.000 --> 00:14:14.801
So, these people really came to him saying, you're, you're not a prophet.

00:14:16.666 --> 00:14:24.000
So, instead of saying, you're not a prophet, they said, what, what is, what, what about the phases of the moon?

00:14:24.000 --> 00:14:26.000
Tell us about the phases of the moon.

00:14:26.533 --> 00:14:28.245
But that's not the real question.

